 [\fITAG\-NUMBERS\fR]

.PP
Tags are exported to file
\fIFILE\fR
in the format with the name
\fIFORMAT\-NAME\fR
(e\&.g\&.
\fB"CSV unquoted"\fR, see
Export)\&.
.RE
.sp
.it 1 an-trap
.nr an-no-space-flag 1
.nr an-break-flag 1
.br
