\fBNumber tracks\fR
.RS 4

.HP \w'\fBnumbertracks\fR\ 'u

\fBnumbertracks\fR
 [\fITRACK\-NUMBER\fR]
 [\fITAG\-NUMBERS\fR]

.PP
Number the selected tracks starting with
\fITRACK\-NUMBER\fR
(1
if omitted)\&.
.RE
.sp
.it 1 an-trap
.nr an-no-space-flag 1
.nr an-break-flag 1
.br
.ps +1
\fBFilter\fR
.RS 4

.HP \w'\fBfilter\fR\ 'u

\fBfilter\fR
 [
 | \fIFILTER\-NAME\fR
 | \fIFILTER\-FORMAT\fR
]

.PP
Filter the files so that only the files matching the
\fIFILTER\-FORMAT\fR
are visible\&. The name of a predefined filter expression (e\&.g\&.
\fB"Filename Tag Mismatch"\fR) can be used instead of a filter expression, see
Filter\&.


.sp
.if n \{\
.RS 4
.\}
.nf
kid3\-cli> \fBfilter \*(Aq%{title} contains "tro"\*(Aq\fR
Started
  /home/urs/One Hit Wonder \- Let\*(Aqs Tag
+ 01 Intro\&.mp3
\- 02 We Only Got This One\&.mp3
+ 03 Outro\&.mp3
Finished
kid3\-cli> \fBls\fR
  1\-\- 01 Intro\&.mp3
  1\-\- 03 Outro\&.mp3
kid3\-cli> \fBfilter All\fR
Started
  /home/urs/One Hit Wonder \- Let\*(Aqs Tag
+ 01 Intro\&.mp3
+ 02 We Only Got This One\&.mp3
+ 03 Outro\&.mp3
Finished
kid3\-cli> \fBls\fR
  1\-\- 01 Intro\&.mp3
  12\- 02 We Only Got This One\&.mp3
  1\-\- 03 Outro\&.mp3
.fi
.if n \{\
.RE
.\}
.sp
.RE
