.ps +1
\fBFilename from tag\fR
.RS 4

.HP \w'\fBfromtag\fR\ 'u

\fBfromtag\fR
 [\fIFORMAT\fR]
 [\fITAG\-NUMBERS\fR]

.PP
Set the file names of the selected files from values in the tags, for example
\fBfromtag \*(Aq%{track} \- %{title}\*(Aq 1\fR\&. If no format is specified, the format set in the
GUI
is used\&.
.RE
.sp
.it 1 an-trap
.nr an-no-space-flag 1
.nr an-break-flag 1
.br
.ps +1
\fBTag from filename\fR
.RS 4

.HP \w'\fBtotag\fR\ 'u

\fBtotag\fR
 [\fIFORMAT\fR]
 [\fITAG\-NUMBERS\fR]

.PP
Set the tag frames from the file names, for example
\fBtotag \*(Aq%{albumartist} \- %{album}/%{track} %{title}\*(Aq 2\fR\&. If no format is specified, the format set in the
GUI
is used\&. If the format of the filename does not match this pattern, a few other commonly used formats are tried\&.
.RE
.sp
.it 1 an-trap
.nr an-no-space-flag 1
.nr an-break-flag 1
.br
